config LINUX_AKSENSOR
	tristate "Anyka legacy sensor stack (aksensor)"
	depends on SOC_CAMERA && I2C && OF_GPIO
	depends on !AK_ISP_CHAR
	help
	  The first AK39 generation's SCCB/I2C sensor stack (aksensor.c/
	  wrap_sensor.c) and its camera_*.c client drivers below, used by
	  the ISP v1 host (VIDEO_AK_ISP1). It binds the same
	  "anyka,sensor0" node and driver name as the ISP2 sensor glue that
	  AK_ISP_CHAR builds, so only one of the two can be selected.

	  If unsure, say N.

